{%- comment -%}
  Renders a product title with the brand lowercased.

  Admin product titles are stored as "Aira Kit" / "Aira refill tabs", but the
  standard is "aira" lowercase everywhere, including mid-heading. Rather than
  depend on the admin titles staying correct, normalise at render so every
  surface (PDP h1, cards, cart drawer, search, sticky bars) agrees.

  Replaces the word only, so the rest of the title keeps its casing and this
  stays safe for future products whose names are not just the brand.

  Accepts:
    title  - string, required. Usually product.title or item.product.title.

  Usage:
    {%- render 'product-title', title: product.title -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{{- title | replace: 'AIRA', 'aira' | replace: 'Aira', 'aira' -}}
